      "speech_seconds": 6.585875,
      "scene_seconds": 8.035875,
      "facial_timing": "Character.facial(auto_lip=True)",
      "text": "You won't be able to park another ship. You can still collect a stored ship or swap it with your current one. A swap doesn't need an empty berth."
